    "why": "Dropping an unknown key in the fact builder proves the fact builder. It does not prove that the renderer would refuse the key if something else supplied it. Injecting past the builder is the only version of this test that exercises the rule that actually protects a filed document: a field with no registered mapping cannot be written, whatever the caller knows.",
